  "story": {
    "day": 24,
    "title": "Kaya's Winter Memories",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya was a student from Japan.",
      "Last November, she visited South Korea with my teacher.",
      "She always carried a lovely card and a dictionary.",
      "This dictionary was not difficult because she liked English too.",
      "In January, her gray dog sat near her desk.",
      "Then, Kaya was cooking so he watched her with one eye.",
      "\"Yes, I'm busy now,\" she said to the dog.",
      "Next, I saw her smile at the window.",
      "\"You are very kind,\" she said to her friend."
    ]
  }
